<title>UK: Hardy Oil posts higher H1 pretax profit.</title>
<headline>Hardy Oil posts higher H1 pretax profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.3		    vs 0.2</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.7		    vs 0.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   21.0		   vs 24.7</p>
<p> Operating profit	 5.4		    vs 2.7</p>
<p> Tax			  0.1		    vs 0.4</p>
<p> Net taxed		  2.6		    vs 0.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Hardy Oil &amp; Gas Plc is an exploration and production company.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
